1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,893
COVID did not come from an animal.

2
00:00:02,033 --> 00:00:03,671
The United States just admitted it.

3
00:00:04,011 --> 00:00:05,405
That is not the disturbing part.

4
00:00:05,745 --> 00:00:07,894
Sixteen days after the world shut down,

5
00:00:08,014 --> 00:00:11,254
the Pentagon's own intelligence agency
writes a document.

6
00:00:11,534 --> 00:00:13,287
Subject: one lab in Wuhan.

7
00:00:13,547 --> 00:00:16,135
Bat coronaviruses. Infectious clones.

8
00:00:16,235 --> 00:00:18,778
Chimeric spike genes, already engineered.

9
00:00:19,078 --> 00:00:22,975
June. They run the genome. Three
scientists conclude: manipulated.

10
00:00:23,295 --> 00:00:25,952
August twenty twenty-one. The President is
briefed.

11
00:00:26,092 --> 00:00:28,728
That conclusion, reportedly, never enters
the room.

12
00:00:29,128 --> 00:00:31,947
For six years the answer stayed one word.
Unknown.

13
00:00:32,207 --> 00:00:34,193
It took a court order to get those pages
out.

14
00:00:34,513 --> 00:00:37,368
They didn't discover anything. They caught
up to their own file.

15
00:00:37,868 --> 00:00:39,471
The question was never what happened.

16
00:00:39,751 --> 00:00:40,808
It's who already knew.

17
00:00:41,358 --> 00:00:42,380
Twenty twenty-seven.
